        <div className="flex-1 text-center md:text-left">
          <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-blue-900">Compliance & Security</h3>
          <p className="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1 max-w-2xl font-medium">
            All documents are encrypted and stored according to Srinidhi Associates' data protection standards. 
            History tracking ensures a transparent audit trail for your professional record. 
            Verification typically takes 24-48 business hours.
